  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion of Peace and development Inititative in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa Province, Pakistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A contribution to the peace and development process in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa province has been made through the promotion of social and economic structures. Social cohesion among members from 65 communities in Khyber District is stabilised and at least 800 households are economically empowered. The region is economically revitalised</narrative>
  </description>
